move wholesale to alpha/mips/xxx with NT, or, shock horror, migrate
the core server software base to the desktop. Unix/unix or vms/vms
instead of unix/nt or vms/nt.

But, given the vulenerability of all of these to even one or two
people becoming unavailable, or materials problems etc, the next 18
mon to 2 years could be real fun.

