Yes, mostly the buzzword spewing bill gates loving executives who yuck it up in
mahogany tabled conference rooms. They are finally realizing the money it takes
to administer all those clients PC's, and the number of times they get wanked
by anyone who wants to, requiring a visit from a support person to 'fix' them.
