the only DIP switch. I think "up" tells the system to use the serial console
instead of the video card - but note that some tests can fail before the box
gets around to seeing that it should use the serial console.

  Oh, and I think the terminal cable goes in the connector with a picture of
a printer, not the one with the "two way traffic" sign.

