Exactly.  If our Sun network were to be stolen, blown up or burnt to
the ground we might lose about a week or 2 of work, at maximum, big
companies would poor scorn on this.  When there was a fire at a Digital
site in the UK they lost less than 2 hours work.  A lot of PC users
would have to re-install from scratch and lose every piece of data they
