references: <Du2IrD.LBx@cee.hw.ac.uk> <4sniad$gbl@vidar.diku.dk> <31EFA203.356B@swcp.com> <zalmanDut8Ls.Juv@netcom.com> <4sr0ts$q73@news.iastate.edu>
