  I'm not a big StorageWorks fan (I integrated one BA350 for a customer),
but I think I remember how to do this. There's a *big* plug on the back
of the backplane (under one of the fan modules) which you take out and
either rotate 180 degrees or stick on an adjacent empty connector (I for-
