Unlikely. Now that I work on a video application, I have a use for 64-bit
support, but not for performance reasons. (Mostly 'cause 64-bit integers
would be "big enough" for certain purposes and the compilers I use don't
implement long long.)

: >That we are even having an argument about 366 MHz 21164 performance vs.
