    of non-standard low voltage swing signalling, and its very deep
    pipelining.

>it?  Look good on benchmarks?  Has the Alpha had _any_ affect on the
>Intel front?  If it is signifcantly faster and cheaper, more power to
>them.  With MS working closely with DEC, the Alpha might have a chance
>of actually being a viable alternative.
