<tex.pro>. [1] 
>>
Filter 'd' terminated (sig=-1,err=0)
lpsof   Jun 28 14:35:23:  Failure to open lpsif pid file(/var/spool/lps17/.lpsifpid): Bad file number
lpsof   Jun 28 14:35:25:  CRITICAL FAILURE in contacting lpsif filter
lpsof   Jun 28 14:35:25:  Terminating current print session with lps17
